@startuml
title Device Connector — диаграмма кода (Protocol Adapter)

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class MessageHandler {
  + HandleDeviceMessage(raw []byte)
  + HandleCommand(cmd DeviceCommand)
}

class AdapterRegistry {
  - adapters map[string]Adapter
  + Get(protocol string) Adapter
}

interface Adapter {
  + Normalize(raw []byte) DeviceEvent
  + EncodeCommand(cmd DeviceCommand) []byte
}

class ZigbeeAdapter {
  - protocol string = "zigbee"
  - baseTopic string = "zigbee2mqtt"
}

class GenericMqttAdapter {
  - protocol string = "generic_mqtt"
  - baseTopic string = "warmhouse/devices"
}

class DeviceEvent {
  + DeviceID string
  + Metric string
  + Value float64
}

class DeviceCommand {
  + DeviceID string
  + Action string
}

MessageHandler --> AdapterRegistry : выбирает адаптер
AdapterRegistry --> Adapter : хранит
Adapter <|.. ZigbeeAdapter
Adapter <|.. GenericMqttAdapter
Adapter ..> DeviceEvent
Adapter ..> DeviceCommand

note right of Adapter
  Новый партнёр = новый класс,
  реализующий Adapter.
  Остальной код не меняется.
end note

@enduml
